<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta stock market was closed on Thursday for a public holiday and will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, the Jakarta Composite Index closed 1.27 points higher, or 0.19 percent, at 654.09 points after touching an intra-day low of 652.15 points.</p>
